flowchart TD
    A[Full K0, current catalog and independent evidence stay local] --> B{Program detects change or credible anomaly?}
    B -->|No| C[Reuse frozen knowledge]
    B -->|Yes| D[Program synchronizes metadata and removes dangling rules]
    D --> E[One light global semantic screen: purpose, existing rules, change summary]
    E --> F[Union required, potential and uncertain candidates; exact ID coverage]
    F --> G[Candidate-only evidence fields; deduplicate and split related packets]
    G --> H[LLM edits local semantic rules only]
    H --> I{Program admission: scope, schemas, routes, preservation, finite independent evidence}
    I -->|Evidence/admission incomplete and allowance remains| G
    I -->|Budget exhausted| J[Stop update; preserve unresolved items and all costs]
    I -->|Pass| K[Publish versioned KB and freeze knowledge plus acceptance]
    C --> L[Execute task with frozen configuration]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Check actual result and artifacts; Python code tested when applicable]
    M -->|Within predeclared code repair allowance| N[Repair code only; retest with same frozen tests]
    N --> M
    M --> O[Preserve original trajectory, TF/PE, artifact status and costs]
    O --> P[Post-run program diagnosis; semantic causes remain hypotheses]
    P --> Q[Stale KB: independent evidence for FUTURE version only]
    P --> R[Delivery issue: inspect retrieval and injection]
    P --> S[Execution/code issue: record bounded repair outcome]
    P --> T[Uncertain/evaluator issue: preserve unresolved evidence]
